# Server Authority (`server.js`)

This file owns the game. Clients only display results.

## Must stay on the server
- Movement validation (`validateMovementPath`)
- Initiative (Guard > Advance > March; same order = simultaneous)
- Ranged (distance 2) and melee (distance 1) combat
- Spillover damage (highest `baseHp` first)
- Room / hub state transitions and gold changes

## Patch style
- Edit the smallest function that fixes the bug or adds the feature.
- Do not rename socket events (`JOIN_GAME`, `STATE_SYNC`, `submit-turn`, `resolve-round`, etc.) without an explicit request.
- When adding logic, include short plain-English comments (what / why), especially around combat and state transitions.

## Combat reminders
- March → 0 ranged damage
- Initiative strike gets `Math.floor(power * 1.2)` in melee; counter-strike does not
- After first strike, defender power is recalculated from survivors only
